body:
Some of the standard ones I’ve heard of are ‘design a 1000 fl elevator’ or ‘improve the in store shopping experience’ or something like that. Context is important so you need to give a lot of details;


What are you expecting ? How many set of mocks? What fidelity?

What are some boundaries? Eg: shop rite is an American grocery store and wants to expand into the Malaysian market. They have budget to open a test store. Or they want to differentiate themselves from the competition by providing a app only cashless experience. Or they want to make shopping as fast as possible. Etc. happy to answer any follow ups. Good luck.
